        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;El 39&quot; is a short horror experience set in the Buenos Aires neighborhood of Constitución in the early hours of the morning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a guy who's just left a high school reunion party, completely defeated. The girl you liked back in school, once again, didn’t even notice you. It’s already 3 AM, and while trying not to overthink everything, you wander through the streets of Constitución, hoping to catch the last bus of line 39 that takes you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/e1ae2647cc5900eb8144fce7ad302f1e.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a terrifying encounter with a sock vendor, the 39 finally appears. You try to wave it down, but it drives right past you, leaving you stranded in the neighborhood. You have to find a way back—tomorrow you take the exam that will determine whether you graduate or not. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/709e7049dce81b4a1f063b9c72279fd3.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The aesthetic of <i>&quot;El 39&quot;</i> is inspired by classic titles like <i>Silent Hill</i> and <i>Resident Evil</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/b66e0c407ee59ddd994b461733fff399.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is mixed with elements of Argentine popular culture found throughout the game, full of interactables and humor, giving way to what we call a “popcorn horror.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Graffiti</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/9e3075429d3592eb309d1851a700e688.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/b772aba2fc6a597a3b2e3b6970e1ee5d.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iconic (and explorable) places like Ugi’s</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/75bdc8d464ca5c929511ba9929a0ca10.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so much more!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/401ba4d35ae949adabc700843d37b229.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;El 39&quot; is a short horror experience set in the Buenos Aires neighborhood of Constitución in the early hours of the morning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a guy who's just left a high school reunion party, completely defeated. The girl you liked back in school, once again, didn’t even notice you. It’s already 3 AM, and while trying not to overthink everything, you wander through the streets of Constitución, hoping to catch the last bus of line 39 that takes you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/e1ae2647cc5900eb8144fce7ad302f1e.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a terrifying encounter with a sock vendor, the 39 finally appears. You try to wave it down, but it drives right past you, leaving you stranded in the neighborhood. You have to find a way back—tomorrow you take the exam that will determine whether you graduate or not. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/709e7049dce81b4a1f063b9c72279fd3.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The aesthetic of <i>&quot;El 39&quot;</i> is inspired by classic titles like <i>Silent Hill</i> and <i>Resident Evil</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/b66e0c407ee59ddd994b461733fff399.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is mixed with elements of Argentine popular culture found throughout the game, full of interactables and humor, giving way to what we call a “popcorn horror.”</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Graffiti</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/9e3075429d3592eb309d1851a700e688.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/b772aba2fc6a597a3b2e3b6970e1ee5d.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Iconic (and explorable) places like Ugi’s</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/75bdc8d464ca5c929511ba9929a0ca10.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And so much more!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900380/extras/401ba4d35ae949adabc700843d37b229.avif?t=1767958768\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
